<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 18:05:49 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>“每个人都知道你脱离了现实”：Palantir 首席执行官 Alex Karp 表示，他自己的高管告诉他不要再炒作 Foundry</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/everybody-knows-youre-out-of-touch-palantir-ceo-alex-karp-says-his-own-exec-told-him-to-stop-hyping-foundry/</link><description>卡普告诉一屋子的首席执行官，他最好的想法是他的团队认为行不通的想法，风投们曾经问他：“寄生虫在哪里？” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2212772079-e1791475107350.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 17:20:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/everybody-knows-youre-out-of-touch-palantir-ceo-alex-karp-says-his-own-exec-told-him-to-stop-hyping-foundry/</guid></item><item><title>超级富豪正在附近购买房屋，以保持员工的亲密关系，拉里·埃里森和马克·扎克伯格就是两个例子</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/ultrawealthy-buying-nearby-homes-to-keep-staff-close-larry-ellison-mark-zuckerberg/</link><description>埃里森花费了近 1000 万美元为他的员工在佛罗里达州的庄园附近购买了住房，而扎克伯格则花费了超过 1.1 亿美元购买了他在帕洛阿尔托的街区。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2197466221-e1791400262575.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 07:04:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/ultrawealthy-buying-nearby-homes-to-keep-staff-close-larry-ellison-mark-zuckerberg/</guid></item><item><title>金融内部人士以近 23 年来最慢的速度购买自己的股票——银行盈利开始之际，这是一个“负面数据点”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/financial-insiders-stock-buying-slows-bank-earnings-q3/</link><description>VerityData 的本·西尔弗曼 (Ben Silverman) 表示，数据表明内部人士对估值“感到不安”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-539724803.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/financial-insiders-stock-buying-slows-bank-earnings-q3/</guid></item><item><title>“给猪涂口红”：专家称，特朗普的红色柴油计划比汽油价格解决方案更具中期吸引力，甚至卡车司机也承认他是在虚张声势</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/trump-red-dyed-diesel-midterm-elections-gas-prices-iran-war/</link><description>由于伊朗战争使柴油价格保持在每加仑 6 美元以上，分析师表示，降低成本的唯一方法是缓解地缘政治紧张局势。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2286394320-e1791476825410.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 16:42:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/trump-red-dyed-diesel-midterm-elections-gas-prices-iran-war/</guid></item><item><title>“你来自哪里不应该决定你在哪里”：渣打银行如何应对银行业的阶级问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/standard-chartered-taking-on-banking-industry-class-problem/</link><description>财务主管达伦·埃利斯 (Darren Ellis) 正在将社会经济流动性提上渣打银行的议事日程，从而使该银行成为一个更具支持性和包容性的工作场所。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Darren_Ellis_2880x1920.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 04:50:04 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/standard-chartered-taking-on-banking-industry-class-problem/</guid></item><item><title>英伟达留住员工的秘诀是什么？没有组织结构图，扁平化结构，每季度额外休息两天</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/nvidia-secret-to-retaining-staff-no-org-charts-a-flat-structure-two-extra-days-off-every-quarter/</link><description>19 年来，Nvidia 已从一家图形芯片制造商发展成为全球最有价值的公司之一。人力资源总监 Febe Punsalan 表示，尽管发生了这些变化，公司仍保持其使命驱动、员工主导的文化完好无损。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-1258366951-e1791392976203.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 04:44:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/nvidia-secret-to-retaining-staff-no-org-charts-a-flat-structure-two-extra-days-off-every-quarter/</guid></item><item><title>欧洲人喝的啤酒越来越少。喜力欧洲老板有一个计划来避免酝酿中的宿醉</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/europeans-are-drinking-less-beer-heinekens-europe-boss-has-a-plan-to-avoid-a-brewing-hangover/</link><description>在喜力啤酒销量下滑之际，喜力欧洲总裁希望通过削减成本、重组和推广无酒精啤酒来减缓销量下滑。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297509632-2880x1920-1.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 11:49:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/europeans-are-drinking-less-beer-heinekens-europe-boss-has-a-plan-to-avoid-a-brewing-hangover/</guid></item><item><title>西门子医疗如何帮助其国际员工有宾至如归的感觉</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/siemens-healthineers-is-helping-international-staff-feel-at-home/</link><description>欧洲、中东和非洲人才吸引主管 Liza Follert 解释了员工反馈如何影响西门子医疗的包容、保留和招聘方法。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Liza-Follert-head-of-people-attraction-e1790955676722.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 04:33:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/siemens-healthineers-is-helping-international-staff-feel-at-home/</guid></item><item><title>Whole Foods 首席执行官表示，杂货店将使亚马逊从“万能商店”转变为“日常商店”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/whole-foods-ceo-jason-buechel-amazon-grocery/</link><description>另外：《财富》杂志的所有新闻和闲聊。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2271194551-e1791450897375.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 09:25:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/whole-foods-ceo-jason-buechel-amazon-grocery/</guid></item><item><title>玛莎·斯图尔特 (Martha Stewart) 表示，凯马特 (Kmart) 每年向她支付 6500 万美元的特许权使用费，足以支撑她的整个帝国</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/martha-stewart-kmart-royalties-65-million-year-empire/</link><description>在“影响者”成为一个职位之前，斯图尔特将折扣店授权交易转化为近 20 亿美元的年销售额。随后，ImClone 丑闻让她损失了约 10 亿美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297568006.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 15:24:42 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/08/martha-stewart-kmart-royalties-65-million-year-empire/</guid></item></channel></rss>